  <releases>
    <release version="0.2.0" date="2026-11-14">
      <description>
        <p>New conversions, all running on your computer:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Word, PowerPoint, Excel and HTML to PDF, with an optional PDF/A archival format</li>
          <li>PDF to Markdown, keeping headings, lists, emphasis and links</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Office documents are converted with macros disabled and remote content blocked.</p>
